---
<BaseLayout
  title="The 600×400 Tray Size — A Brief History of the Bakery Norm"
  description="How a 1960s German industrial standard became the global default for professional bakeries. The history of the 600×400 mm Bakery Norm and why American bakeries are switching to it."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalPath="/blog/600x400-tray-size-history-and-standard/"
  schemaType="Article"
